<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .success-icon {
      color: #4CAF50;
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .invoice-details {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #2196F3;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
    <h2>Invoice Processed Successfully</h2>
  </div>

  <p>Your invoice has been successfully processed and is now available in your SyntaxisAI dashboard.</p>
  
  <div class="invoice-details">
    <div class="detail-row">
      <strong>Invoice Number:</strong>
      <span>{{invoiceNumber}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="detail-row">
      <strong>Vendor Name:</strong>
      <span>{{vendorName}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="detail-row">
      <strong>Total Amount:</strong>
      <span>{{totalAmount}}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>Click the button below to view the complete invoice details:</p>
  
  <a href="{{viewLink}}" class="button">View Invoice Details</a>
  
  <p>You can also access this invoice anytime through your SyntaxisAI dashboard.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} SyntaxisAI. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 